title: A file tab of a file of 12000 lines goes to line 9000 and a click there puts the caret on that line, so typing lands on it and nowhere else
folders: odd-files
limit: 60
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-file: odd-files/big.rs :: (?s)\npub fn f8998\(\) -> usize \{ 8998 \}\nXpub fn f8999\(\) -> usize \{ 8999 \}\npub fn f9000\(\)

wait 3500
tool edit
tab open big.rs
wait 1500
mark top
wait 450
tab line 9000
wait 1200
mark line-9000
wait 450
tab click 9000 1
wait 600
type X
wait 600
key save
wait 1500
mark saved
wait 450
quit
